# Generated build artifacts are compared byte-for-byte by the catalogue and
# i18n checks, and those scripts write LF. Without this, a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF and `npm run catalogue:check`
# reports the committed output as stale when the content is in fact identical.
src/lib/catalogue/generated/*.json  text eol=lf
docs/CATALOGUE_REPORT.md            text eol=lf
